{"meta":{"extractedFrom":"legacy/islandale-planner.html","sourceSha256":"cf920450cd181ed06d58321fbce1bf42d892d9aabe638e6cb4ac38c99c0257b1","kept":"Scheme C only, of the 12 schemes in the legacy file; the full set is on the main branch"},"schemes":[{"id":"C","name":"C · Prow & Lantern","tag":"recommended · four buildings on one lane · prow · lantern + twin pod · wedge","blurb":"Arrival at the west notch, then one gravel lane runs from the parking to the gathering cabin’s front stair, and every porch opens onto it. The lot-width rule caps all buildings at 57 ft across the lot, so the buildings sit in two rows inside that band: the family cabin on the uphill side looking down the lot toward Mud Bay, the elders’ cabin on the downhill side, and the gathering cabin at the seaward end with its prow aimed down the bay. Family sleeping (487 sq ft): two one-storey pods under one covered porch and breezeway, each household with its own front door. The octagonal lantern pod (Maya, Ren, Leo, Ana) has a hall from the porch, the parents’ room on the water side, the bunk room across the back and a bath on the west flat; the twin pod (Daniel, Sofia) has their two rooms either side of an entry and bath core under a butterfly roof. Every bedroom has a bed and a dresser, every bath its own toilet and sink clearances. Elders’ wedge (441 sq ft, Elena and Tomas): one level, every room off a 5-ft entry hall. The sitting room is on the water and gathering side, with a side door onto a level, railed boardwalk straight to the gathering porch; the accessible bath (60×60 curbless shower, 5-ft turning space) is at the front with a door from the hall and an en-suite door from the bedroom; the bedroom runs across the back with a 3-ft clear path on both sides of the bed and a glazed door to their private covered porch, which the sitting room also opens onto. Arrival is step-free: a level 4-ft boardwalk runs from the drop-off along the front wall to the covered entry (the drop-off’s east edge is graded about 6 in to meet it). Gathering prow: entry and mudroom off the lane, kitchen beside the covered outdoor kitchen, dining for 8 by the east windows, lounge in the prow, hearth between. The cabin is set 4 ft into the slope. Its prow is curved on the west, where the lounge wall and the roof sweep round toward the madrone, and sharp on the east. One deck runs under the side porch and wraps the prow; steps run all the way round the curve, 21 in treads you can sit on, flowing round the madrone’s trunk down to the firepit at their foot; the straight east side keeps its railing. The elders reach the side porch on their own sweeping boardwalk, a 1:21 slope with no steps. 1,599 of 1,600 sq ft enclosed. Sited to the 35-ft reduced setback from top of bank; slide it to 50 to see the strict case.","objects":[{"t":"house","name":"Gathering prow","w":28,"d":26,"h":11,"color":"#c4a77d","lift":0.9,"rot":35,"x":-1.5,"n":0.5,"roofColor":"#3c4043","shape":"poly","roof":"prow","pitch":7,"ridge":"z","overhang":2.5,"support":"posts","postSpacing":8,"postSize":8,"bracing":true,"wings":[{"dx":0,"dz":-16.5,"w":10,"d":7,"h":9,"shape":"oct","roof":"pyramid","pitch":6,"ridge":"x","overhang":1,"kind":"porch","open":true},{"kind":"stair","open":true,"dx":0,"dz":-22.5,"rot":180,"w":5,"d":5,"h":0,"roof":"none","pitch":0,"ridge":"x","overhang":0},{"dx":-3.27,"dz":8.5,"rot":0,"w":45.5,"d":33,"shape":"poly","pts":[[22.73,1.68],[11.12,12.5],[5.27,16.5],[-2.06,16.5],[-4.76,16.32],[-7.41,15.8],[-9.97,14.93],[-12.39,13.73],[-14.64,12.23],[-16.68,10.45],[-18.46,8.41],[-19.96,6.16],[-21.16,3.74],[-22.03,1.18],[-22.55,-1.47],[-22.73,-4.17],[-22.73,-16.5],[-10.73,-16.5],[-10.73,-4.17],[-10.66,-3.04],[-10.43,-1.93],[-10.07,-0.85],[-9.57,0.16],[-8.94,1.11],[-8.19,1.96],[-7.34,2.71],[-6.39,3.34],[-5.38,3.84],[-4.3,4.2],[-3.19,4.43],[-2.06,4.5],[7.97,4.5],[17.27,-4.17]],"kind":"deck","open":true,"h":1,"steps":{"e0":3,"e1":14,"tread":1.75},"roof":"none","pitch":0,"ridge":"x","overhang":0},{"dx":-18,"dz":-1.83